title: ApacheCon Europe 2000 — Sponsors
template: page-event-default
ref: apachecon-eu-2000

The Apache Software Foundation would like to extend a sincere thank you to the following organizations for their support in making ApacheCon Europe 2000 possible.

The [[]Apache Software Foundation](http://www.apache.org/)
would like to extend a sincere thank you to the following
organizations for their support in making this event possible.

- A.L. Digital and The Bunker

