![[]Apache Week](/images/events/apachecon-eu-2000/aw_white_135x38.gif)

[[]Apache Week](http://www.apacheweek.com/)

Published weekly on the web and distributed via email to over
10,000 people world-wide, C2Net's
Apache Week is the definitive online resource for all users of
Apache and Apache-based web servers. Apache Week
covers in-depth features and provides simple tutorials and
how-to's for novice and expert users alike.

![[]EarthWeb](/images/events/apachecon-eu-2000/earthweb_133x22.gif)

[[]EarthWeb](http://www.earthweb.com/)

EarthWeb is the leading provider of business-to-business online
services to the global information technology industry. Through its
flagship services,developer.com, datamation.com, dice.com and
ITKnowledge.com, and its other integrated online services, EarthWeb connects
buyers to sellers, employers to employees, vendors to customers and
technical professionals to a wealth of expert knowledge.

[[]eSecurity Journal](http://www.esecurityjournal.com/)

Every issue of eSecurity Journal provides highly-focused expert
coverage of the entire information security sector, key layers, and
emerging technologies, readers’ feedback and information exchange
forums, in-depth reports of new and emerging security tools and
techniques, editorial coverage of security conferences and trade shows,
event announcements, book reviews, and much more. eSecurity Journal
- the journal for ractitioners who know that, when it comes to
winning battles, there’s no substitute for knowledge.

![[]internet.com](/images/events/apachecon-eu-2000/apache-today_135x49.gif)

