![[]Linux Journal](/images/events/apachecon-eu-2000/linuxjournal_130x74)

[[]Linux Journal](http://www.ssc.com/)

Since 1994 Linux Journal has been bringing readers the information
they need to stay ahead in the fast-paced world of Linux. Inside the
covers you will find the latest news, interviews with leading Linux
personalities, helpful product reviews, and tutorials that will
help both the novice and professional Linux user. Linux Journal - the
most trusted source in the industry.

