![[]XML Journal](/images/events/apachecon-eu-2000/xmlj_135x36.gif)

[[]XML Journal](http://www.xml-journal.com/)

XML-Journal is the premier print publication for business computing
professionals. It provides the latest news, standards updates, new
technology developments, product reviews, tutorials, case studies,
interviews with industry leaders, and many other sources of
information for readers who want to stay abreast of XML technology.

![[]XML Magazine](/images/events/apachecon-eu-2000/XML_mag_110x50.gif)

[[]XML Magazine](http://www.xmlmag.com/)

XML Magazine is the only publication keeping pace with the fast
growing world of XML development. Each issue delivers hands-on
information, timely solutions, with case studies and technical instruction
for incorporating XML into Windows, Java, e-commerce and Web
environments. And XML Magazine is the only publication that has an online
presence that offers discussion forums, expert answers, product
listings, and downloads, and links to the best resources on the Web.

![[]XML.com](/images/events/apachecon-eu-2000/xmlcom_120x49.jpg)

[[]XML.com](http://www.xml.com/pub)

XML.com is the premier site where the XML community shares
resources, information and solutions. The site is specially designed to
serve developers who are already working with XML, as well as Web
developers who want to understand XML's power and complexity. We cover
controversial issues from the front lines on topics like XSL and EDI.

![[]ZOT Group](/images/events/apachecon-eu-2000/zot_111x53.gif)

[[]ZOT Group](http://www.zotgroup.com/)

ZOT Group provides business strategies that integrate Web
technology standards, collaborative partnerships and interactive marketing.
Their clients range from recognized worldwide industry leaders to
